# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editors ---
.idea/
*.swp

# --- Node (only if tooling is added later) ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Video masters + project files -------------------------------------
# Never commit these. GitHub rejects any single file over 100MB, and even
# smaller videos bloat the repo permanently — git keeps every version forever,
# so a 40MB file replaced five times is 200MB in history that cannot be
# removed without rewriting it.
#
# Full videos belong on Cloudflare R2 or Vimeo; put the URL in the
# "video" or "embed" field in data/projects.json instead.
#
# Poster stills and images ARE fine to commit — they're small.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi
*.mkv

# After Effects / Premiere / C4D project files
*.aep
*.prproj
*.c4d

# To commit one of these deliberately anyway:
#   git add -f path/to/file.mp4
